[completion-04] A test asserts that sibling bullets worded alike under one scope
    exclusions heading receive the same disposition as each other.
    -> sibling-exclusions-same-disposition  [functional/explicit]   (also serves constraint-04)
       Apply the same disposition to sibling bullets worded alike under one scope
